{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:57:30+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-19T16:57:30+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Cmb.Tech NV","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","country":"Belgium","city":"Antwerp","website":"https://www.cmb.tech","employees":null,"summary":"Cmb.Tech NV engages in marine transportation business in Belgium. It operates through three divisions: Marine, H2 Infra, and H2 Industry. The Marine division designs, builds, owns, and operates various low and zero carbon ships and vessels, such as crew transfer vessels, ferries, commissioning service operations vessels, tugboats, ammonia-powered large bulk carriers, container ships, and chemical and crude oil tankers. The H2 Infra division develops and secures green molecule supplies; and produces and distributes green hydrogen and ammonia. The H2 Industry division provides scalable dual-fuel industrial applications. The company was formerly known as Euronav NV and changed its name to Cmb.Tech NV in October 2024. Cmb.Tech NV was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Antwerp, Belgium. Cmb.Tech NV is a subsidiary of CMB NV.","exchange":"Brussels","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Cmb.Tech NV exerce des activités de transport maritime en Belgique. Elle opère à travers trois divisions : Marine, H2 Infra et H2 Industry. La division Marine conçoit, construit, possède et exploite divers navires et navires à faible et zéro carbone, tels que les navires de transfert d'équipage, les traversiers, les navires de service de mise en service, les remorqueurs, les grands vraquiers alimentés à l'ammoniac, les porte-conteneurs et les navires-citernes de produits chimiques et de pétrole brut."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4317726208,"shares_outstanding":290169769,"trailing_pe":5.858268,"forward_pe":8.062629,"price_to_book":1.5541549,"ev_to_ebitda":8.391,"ev_to_revenue":4.